This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The OSC wire format, the `/sl/xrfb/facew/*` to Unified Expressions mapping,
the eye-openness formula and the bundle handling were reverse-engineered from
the VRCFT module LinkFT / "SteamLink VRCFT Module"
(https://github.com/ykeara/LinkFT, ykeara, C#/MIT) and its unofficial
SteamLink OSC spec notes. This repository is an independent C++ implementation
of that wire format and contains none of its source code. The protocol is not
published by Valve and remains unverified on real hardware.

